### Proxy home
GET http://localhost:8000/

### Health checks through the proxy
GET http://localhost:8000/ecommerce/health
GET http://localhost:8000/trading/health
GET http://localhost:8000/bidding/health

### Read current service state
GET http://localhost:8000/ecommerce/api/state
GET http://localhost:8000/trading/api/state
GET http://localhost:8000/bidding/api/state

### Publish an e-commerce update
POST http://localhost:8000/ecommerce/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "status": "back-in-stock",
  "inventory": 42
}

### Publish a trading update
POST http://localhost:8000/trading/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "price": 212.50,
  "change": 1.25,
  "action": "quote-update"
}

### Publish a bidding update
POST http://localhost:8000/bidding/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auctionId": "AUCTION-42",
  "bidder": "demo-user",
  "amount": 125,
  "action": "new-bid"
}

### Chat help through the existing server
GET http://localhost:8000/chat/help

### WebSocket URLs for browser or wscat
# ws://localhost:8000/chat
# ws://localhost:8000/ecommerce
# ws://localhost:8000/trading
# ws://localhost:8000/bidding

### Example WebSocket event payloads
# {"type":"event","event":{"productId":"SKU-1001","status":"sold-out"}}
# {"type":"event","event":{"symbol":"MSFT","price":510.25}}
# {"type":"event","event":{"auctionId":"AUCTION-42","amount":150}}
